# files/xp_scan (id 456): used range of sheet 0 by a pass over all 65536 cell slots (KEY words).
# PC 0: read KEY of slot L0. PC 1: x0 = KEY of slot L0: if 1 <= KEY <= 2^34 (sheet 0), row and col of
# K = KEY - 1 update L1 = max row, L2 = max col; L0 += 1; read next KEY, or after slot 65535 read
# HEAP_TOP and go to xp_cell (457) PC 9. Hand-written. Note: weights/files/csv_export.md
input 65
slice 0 0 1                       # v1 [k]
slice 0 8 9                       # v2 [PC]
